</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Modlin</surname><given-names>IM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The diagnosis and management of adult intussusception</article-title><source><italic>American Journal of Surgery</italic></source><year>1997</year><volume>173</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>88</fpage><lpage>94</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-0030965487</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9074370</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stockinger</surname><given-names>ZT</given-names></name><name><surname>McSwain</surname><given-names>N</given-names><suffix>Jr.</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Intussusception caused by abdominal trauma: case report and review of 91 cases reported in the literature</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Trauma</italic></source><year>2005</year><volume>58</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>187</fpage><lpage>188</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-13544267644</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15674172</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Falor</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Multiple intussusceptions, direct and retrograde, of traumatic origin</article-title><source><italic>Annals of Surgery</italic></source><year>1948</year><volume>127</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>730</fpage><lpage>737</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Komadina</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Smrkolj</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Intussusception after blunt abdominal trauma</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Trauma</italic></source><year>1998</year><volume>45</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>615</fpage><lpage>616</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-0031691054</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9751561</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Duncan</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Phillips</surname><given-names>TF</given-names></name><name><surname>Sclafani</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Intussusception following abdominal trauma</article-title><source><italic>Journal of Trauma</italic></source><year>1987</year><volume>27</volume><issue>11</issue><fpage>1193</fpage><lpage>1199</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-0023604664</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3682031</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bashir</surname><given-names>MO</given-names></name><name><surname>Lynch</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Post traumatic intussusception in an adult</article-title><source><italic>Irish Journal of Medical Science</italic></source><year>1993</year><volume>162</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>p. 20</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="other">2-s2.0-0027457507</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Berne</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Asensio</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Gomez</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Chahwan</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Falabella</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Double intussusception in an adult following a lapar